    "spine": {
      "anchors": [
        {
          "firstLineText": "Every evidence aggregate must agree on canonicalScope, selected profile, History flag, exact source commit, actual installed payload, complete installed contracts/schema closure, policy, authentication association and exact fixture source/derived capabilities. Existing bindServedProfileConfiguration validates closed data/digest shape and equality, not the truth of observations; trusted installer/owner capture and independent raw provenance must establish truth. TX compares actual per-session runtime and served bindings; the RU association checks source/configuration, complete selected/result IDs, route digest, actual ready/session metadata and cleanup. Private ready.targets verifies trusted setup only; cold-client discovery must use real Scope\u2192actual Link\u2192descriptor\u2192actual Directory and actual returned targets. A separate qualified Read listener cannot supply inherited Read evidence for RU/TX.",
          "lines": [
            13
          ],
          "needle": "Every evidence aggregate"
        },
        {
          "firstLineText": "A later fresh installed generator must wait for root-accepted final combined source/configuration and proper D3 lifecycle/cold navigation. Build exact candidate, pack/verify archives, install into a fresh external consumer with exact lock/proof/tool identities, capture actual entry/payload/configuration, run all applicable selected laws and inherited laws with their full semantic/afterstate/oracle controls, and retain raw attempts/response bytes plus genuine cleanup/terminal ownership evidence. Workspace-dist or source regression alone cannot supply installed credit. Exact commands/budgets remain future reviewed packet inputs; do not transplant startup45/10/60 bounds into existing90/120 cohorts. Never rerun failed evidence under the same attempt or copy historical outputs as fresh. The artifact verifier must rederive actual selection/conditions and require all selected applicable obligations complete, rather than trusting a declared count or removing failed rows.",
          "lines": [
            21
          ],
          "needle": "A later fresh installed generator"
        },
        {
          "firstLineText": "Residual conditions are exact. D2S1 Snapshot/continuation anchor versus serving minimum and G2 metadata-only incident Link Event membership remain unresolved for affected full-support claims. D3a source is not frozen here; ordinary trusted RU/TX intended-listener lifecycle/readback and public capability/profile selection remain separate steps. D4 schema/ownership/auth/policy/restart needs final same-configuration evidence; missing administrative erasure ingestion/retained-copy assurance or logical restore route is notN/A, and Historyfalse does not waive mandatory TX erasure framing/retained-copy duties. Graceful reopen is not logical restore or physical powerloss; RU continuity/newScope and TX epoch/key/ledger laws stay distinct. No extra optional History/IAM/CORS requirement or new wire semantics is added. These unresolved questions do not block independent carrier/planning work, but they prevent an unsupported full completion claim.",
          "lines": [
            25
          ],
          "needle": "Residual conditions are exact"
        },
        {
          "firstLineText": "Admission/sealing also has a concrete engineering identity gate: installed-payload.ts hashes the actual server/protocol dist and dependencies, including any shipped capability constant. Adding a server Write constant changes the measured payload. The later admission plan must address this without a hash fixed point, secret file exclusions, normalized identity changes or falsely labeling the pre-admission payload final. Prefer a separately verified non-secret administrative evidence input outside measured runtime closure if the implementation review accepts that placement/authority; exact design remains in the later admission plan. Retain current actual payload identity and old Read verifier. Public activation requires independent verified provenance and current configuration, then final shipping validation/CI\u2014not trusting the candidate's own readiness flag. No public-admission bypass is proposed here.",
          "lines": [
            23
          ],
          "needle": "Admission/sealing"
        }
      ],
